Xiaohongshu MCP Readonly

This distribution is a modified fork of:
https://github.com/xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp

The original Apache License 2.0 and copyright notice are retained in LICENSE.

This fork changes the public interface to a localhost-only read-only MCP,
adds conservative access pacing, dual Xiaohongshu/RedNote site support,
durable QR login verification, a local login page, and additional security
hardening.
